Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:53.54,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,使命を果たせ 今こそ 完璧な旋律で
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.49,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,どう足掻きもがこうと 無駄なことさ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.03,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.63,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,轟かせろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:06.53,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.50,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,勝利を我らの手に Hi!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:08:59.35,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:19.97,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:25.10,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,さあ、フィナーレの時間だ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:04.71,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:53.54,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,是時候完成使命了 奏響起完美的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.49,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,任何的掙扎 也都是徒勞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.03,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,背水一戰！背水一戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.63,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,轟鳴吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:06.53,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,背水一戰！背水一戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.50,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,將勝利握於我等之手 嗨!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:08:59.35,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:19.97,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,背水一戰！背水一戰！背水一戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:25.10,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,聽吧 終曲響起了！
Comment: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:46.07,Default2,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:47.86,Default2,,0,0,0,,上吧 豪奪樂隊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:52.41,Meteor,,0,0,0,,真的假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:54.32,Zeal,,0,0,0,,這歌 比我們的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.55,Ripple,,0,0,0,,還要更響徹！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:03.61,Default2,,0,0,0,,必須用力奔跑 才能使自己留在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.37,Default2,,0,0,0,,進化是沒有盡頭的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:11.24,Default2,,0,0,0,,人是不得不一直向前進的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:32.22,Neige,,0,0,0,,那是 哪邊的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:45.98,Default2,,0,0,0,,與那時相反的結果呢 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:52.42,Default2,,0,0,0,,我們的全新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:56.89,Default2,,0,0,0,,有深刻地烙印在你們的身體 你們的心中嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.15,Viola,,0,0,0,,大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:19:59.90,Neige,,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:06.50,Ripple,,0,0,0,,為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:08.16,Default2,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.68,Neige,,0,0,0,,水萌姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:14.29,Ripple,,0,0,0,,你們說過的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:19.84,Ripple,,0,0,0,,我們總有一天 會理解你們行動的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:24.72,Ripple,,0,0,0,,但是 不理解啊！我們沒有理解啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:28.72,Ripple,,0,0,0,,赤紅女王和雪白女王都已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:31.42,Ripple,,0,0,0,,你們究竟要做什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:40.01,Default2,,0,0,0,,是啊 2位女王已經回歸為純粹的音悅力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:44.53,Default2,,0,0,0,,但是 即便如此 這愛麗絲比亞還有王在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.74,Ripple,,0,0,0,,王？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.04,Default2,,0,0,0,,正好大駕光臨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:56.07,Default2,,0,0,0,,你們可得看清楚了 愛麗絲比亞之王的英姿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.61,Ripple,,0,0,0,,納比尤？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:54.03,Default2,,0,0,0,,對 我就是愛麗絲比亞的王·納比尤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:22:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,王
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:37.78,Meteor,,0,0,0,,回憶起來了 一同歡笑的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:40.39,Meteor,,0,0,0,,與現王權分道揚鑣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.59,0:23:43.91,Meteor,,0,0,0,,哇 這種風格果然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.11,0:23:46.44,Meteor,,0,0,0,,下集 白色再度綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.54,Meteor,,0,0,0,,納比助 你真的背叛了嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}OMO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
